(footprint "Shield_Hammond_1551B_Top"
	(version 20260206)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Hammond 1551B enclosure, TOP half only, used as the HV safety shield (1551BTRD/BCLR/BTSK/BBK/BGY). Mechanical reference footprint -- no copper, no drills. All geometry is derived from Hammond's own STEP model, https://www.hammfg.com/files/parts/stp/1551BTRD.zip. Shell 50.000 x 25.000 mm; parting plane at Z=0 with a lip reaching 2.514 mm below it. Footprint origin is the shell centre; the screw end is +Y (south). Screws: 2x #2 x 1/2 in flat head, on a 19.000 mm pitch at Y=+22.000. Underside features that must clear the board: two side rails and two snap tabs, drawn here on Dwgs.User.")
	(tags "hammond 1551B enclosure shield mechanical")
